>1.22 (0.63)</td><td align="left">1.53 (0.98)</td><td align="left">1.24 (0.42)</td></tr><tr><td align="left">&#x02003;Emotional Support</td><td align="left">2.40 (0.95)</td><td align="left">2.17 (0.91)</td><td align="left">2.56 (0.97)</td><td align="left">2.29 (0.85)</td></tr><tr><td align="left">&#x02003;Instrumental Support</td><td align="left">2.32 (0.96)</td><td align="left">2.61 (0.93)</td><td align="left">2.78 (0.75)</td><td align="left">2.66 (0.99)</td></tr><tr><td align="left">&#x02003;Behavioral Disengagement</td><td align="left">1.33 (0.51)</td><td align="left">1.27 (0.38)</td><td align="left">1.47 (0.44)</td><td align="left">1.47 (0.94)</td></tr><tr><td align="left">&#x02003;Venting</td><td align="left">1.93 (0.63)</td><td align="left">2.09 (0.77)</td><td align="left">2.39 (0.65)</td><td align="left">2.11 (.077)</td></tr><tr><td align="left">&#x02003;Positive Reframing</td><td align="left">2.20 (1.06)</td><td align="left">2.28 (0.94)</td><td align="left">2.75 (0.96)</td><td align="left">2.53 (1.05)</td></tr><tr><td align="left">&#x02003;Planning</td><td align="left">2.97 (0.97)</td><td align="left">3.00 (0.98)</td><td align="left">3.00 (0.86)</td><td align="left">3.03 (0.86)</td></tr><tr><td align="left">&#x02003;Humor</td><td align="left">1.68 (0.79)<sup>a</sup></td><td align="left">1.78 (0.87)</td><td align="left">2.39 (1.20)<sup>a</sup></td><td align="left">1.79 (0.77)</td></tr><tr><td align="left">&#x02003;Acceptance</td><td align="left">2.95 (0.88)</td><td align="left">2.81 (0.83)</td><td align="left">2.94 (0.75)</td><td align="left">2.95 (0.80)</td></tr><tr><td align="left">&#x02003;Religion</td><td align="left">2.41 (1.01)</td><td align="left">2.44 (0.97)</td><td align="left">2.31 (1.06)</td><td align="left">2.47 (1.05)</td></tr><tr><td align="left">&#x02003;Self Blame</td><td align="left">1.69 (0.87)</td><td align="left">1.74 (0.75)</td><td align="left">2.00 (0.77)</td><td align="left">1.92 (0.79)</td></tr><tr><td align="left">Beck Depression Inve